# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — perfpilot-ui (Agent Frontend) image
#
# Placed next to the Dockerfile so this image's context exclusions are
# co-located with the build spec. The repo-root .dockerignore covers
# the same patterns (and more), so this file is a targeted safety net /
# documentation of what MUST NEVER be shipped for this specific image.
#
# CRITICAL: node_modules and .next MUST be excluded — a local `npm run
# dev` on this repo leaves ~1.5 GB of build artifacts in
# agent-framework/frontend/ui/ that would otherwise be COPY'd into the
# image on top of the fresh `npm ci` performed inside the Dockerfile.
# =============================================================================

.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.git
.gitignore
*.log
node_modules
.next
